@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token-from-login

### Backend health
GET http://localhost:3001/health
Accept: application/json

### Login (forwarded to the nutrition microservice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "pulsefit-demo",
  "password": "configure-a-demo-password"
}

### Search foods
GET {{baseUrl}}/nutrition/search?query=banana&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Calculate macros
GET {{baseUrl}}/nutrition/macro-breakdown/3017620422003?quantityGrams=150
Accept: application/json

### Create an authenticated food log
POST {{baseUrl}}/nutrition/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodId": "3017620422003",
  "quantityGrams": 150,
  "mealType": "snack"
}

### Validation error example
GET {{baseUrl}}/nutrition/search?query=
Accept: application/json
